    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445640/extras/04094d1492f3a453e9388ed467414e0d.poster.avif?t=1747269245\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445640/extras/04094d1492f3a453e9388ed467414e0d.webm?t=1747269245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445640/extras/04094d1492f3a453e9388ed467414e0d.mp4?t=1747269245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Edge Of is a Mystery NTR visual novel with a tense atmosphere and a story that will keep you on The Edge Of your seat. The Definitive Edition will have one organic art style, extend Beth's perspective, and add more beautiful illustrations. Play as either Sam as he grapples with the fact that his wife might be cheating on him, or Beth, the lovely wife who couldn't possibly be cheating... or is she?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445640/extras/4876099207c374766cea3b1a151affca.avif?t=1747269245\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming back home after a week-long business trip, Sam can't help but sense that something isn't quite right the moment he set foot inside his house. Is it the fact that his newlywed wife was sleeping in the afternoon rather than waiting impatiently for his return? Or is it because she was rather evasive the moment he questioned her about it? Or maybe it is simply his weary mind playing tricks on him? The latter seems like the most compelling answer, or so he thought, but as he finds himself gazing at a selfie his wife sent him during his business trip--a selfie in her lingerie--he notices something he